# 音量ミキサー (design 11.6, 6.5.6), for tools/ui_run.py with --wav F: two programs play at
# once (SVCPROG.ELF's tone, 500Hz and 1500Hz, the same on both sides) and the system's
# clicks; the mixer lists them; the first is turned down, the second muted, and the
# whole's left alone turned down, three seconds apart, so that tools/tests/wav_tones.py F
# shows each in what was heard: 500Hz lower, then 1500Hz gone, then the left lower than
# the right. The window is at 200,100, its panel from 210,128: in a row k (from 0) of
# アプリケーション, the volume from 486 to 620 at y 365+40k and 消音 at 716,403 for row 1;
# 左右をそろえる at 494,287 and the whole's left from 326 to 606 at y 220. Ctrl+E closes.
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 38 500 40000
wait 300
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 38 1500 40000
wait 300
look 9155 1
open 01a0d8c4-5440-7a51-8c62-7e8f90a15440
expect sndmix: ready
wait 1500
win 音量ミキサー
click 600 300
wait 1500
expect sndmix: 3 programs
shot mix_three
wait 3000
# the first turned down: a little above the left end
click 500 365
expect sndmix: SVCPROG.ELF
wait 3000
shot mix_down
# the second muted
click 716 403
expect mute 1 (0)
wait 3000
# the whole's left alone, its right as it was
click 494 287
wait 300
click 360 220
expect sndmix: whole
wait 3000
shot mix_left
# all back
click 600 220
click 494 287
click 716 403
click 610 365
wait 1500
shot mix_back
look 9155 0
key 08 01
wait 500
absent !OACV!
